                      "fill": "$ahc-muted",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "There are two types: Manipulations are adjustments made to your joints that relieve pain and improve mobility. Modalities are procedures that make it easier to adjust your joints.",
