                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Thermotherapy (heat) and cryotherapy (cold) are used in rehabilitation treatments. Heat increases blood flow and decreases joint stiffness. Cold reduces inflammation and nerve activity.",
